description	"Dantooine Homesteader

Settlers just trying to defend their properties.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- A Stick
-- Cyan Style Saber
-- No Blaster/Saber Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- No Blocking
-- Low Damage, Cripples
- Hunting Rifle
-- Proj
-- Staggers on hit
-- 75% less damage
-- 60% slower mag reload
-- 20% Slower Velocity
- Self Defense Pistol
-- DC Carbine (1)
-- 10% More Damage/FP Drain, 200% Slower RoF

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (4)
- Stamina (1)
- Assemble (3)
- Ammo (1)

^8Abilities:
- Tracking Dart (1) ^3[CS4]
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS1]
- Dodge (1) ^3[CS2]"
